  "sn15.15:1.1": "Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati || || 2 ",
  "sn15.15:1.2": "Anamataggāyaṃ bhikkhave saṃsāro || [Sabbesam evam peyyālo] || || 3 ",
  "sn15.15:1.3": "Na so bhikkhave satto sulabharūpo yo na pitābhūtapubbo || ",
  "sn15.15:1.4": "la || || ",
  "sn15.15:1.5": "Pañcamaṃ || || 1 "
